    {
      "date": "1974-01-10",
      "kind": "occupancy",
      "description": "The 6,944-square-foot corner lot, with about 100 feet on 19th Avenue and 71 feet on Judah Street, held a non-conforming Union Oil automobile service station whose use was due to expire on May 2, 1980.",
